          "understand",
          "clarify",
          "expired",
          "generate",
          "check",
          "source",
          "poll",
          "stop"
        ],
        "note": "只有歧义会改变结果时才追问。可点选或直接回复，补充与纠正在本轮一并理解；明确换题则按新问数核对条件。"
      },
      {
        "id": "feedback",
        "label": "问题如何回告",
        "focus": [
          "gap",
          "rate",
          "queue",
          "business",
          "technical",
          "dataOwner",
          "verify",
          "notify"
